(text "CONTROLS SUBCIRCUIT ONLY - NOT A COMPLETE CONSOLE\nNamed nets go to the Pico GPIOs shown. No MCU, display, supply or key-port circuit on this sheet.\nActive-low switches. External 10k pull-ups to console 3V3; never use 5V.\nPhysical encoder footprint and final resistor procurement codes are not assigned." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 20.32 15.24 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid "2bcdd9f4-9b3a-50de-b8a8-ea2433ce2b9d"))
